    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Desktop and tablet show a cohesive, polished cyber-operations aesthetic with strong headline hierarchy, disciplined cyan/green/red semantics, consistent borders, and a convincing master-detail composition. Mobile degrades substantially: typography and controls become extremely small, rows turn into tall sparse cards, the section becomes excessively long, and dense trace copy strains legibility. The mobile header also drops the product name and presents a visibly clipped navigation sequence; header contrast remains unverified for 12 mobile nodes and one tablet node.",
